[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0828","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0828.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1173","title":"Microsys CyberPatrol 注册信息弱加密敏感数据泄露漏洞","description":"Microsys CyberPatrol 4.0 4.003及4.005版本在注册过程中使用弱编码（简单编码转换）加密信用卡号，而其余注册信息则以明文方式传输，未采用任何加密保护。攻击者可通过嗅探网络流量捕获这些敏感信息，导致用户信用卡号和个人隐私数据泄露。该漏洞影响 CyberPatrol 4.0系列版本，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1173"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18.767","remediation":"Microsys CyberPatrol 已停止维护且厂商不再提供更新补丁，建议立即停止使用该版本，迁移至其他受支持的网页内容过滤软件。如无法替换，应在网络层面强制所有注册流量通过 VPN 或 TLS 加密隧道传输，避免敏感信息在网络上明文传输。同时禁止在不受信网络中执行软件注册操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0323.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1977","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20425","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1173","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1173.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e38df7a80f8aa0122f9b0f7f660a5a952c979cc6/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7rc9-qwrm-pj39/GHSA-7rc9-qwrm-pj39.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1173.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7dd680ed-9889-4043-aee9-011f5ecbabf3.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1977/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0828.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0828.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0828.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0827","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0827.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1171","title":"Markus Triska CGIForum 1.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"CGIForum 1.0 的 cgiforum.pl 脚本中存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 \"thesection\" 参数提交包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制请求，突破路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 CGIForum 1.0 版本，无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者只需构造简单的 HTTP 请求即可触发该漏洞，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1171"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18.540","remediation":"升级 CGIForum 至已修复目录遍历漏洞的最新版本；如无官方更新，手动修改 cgiforum.pl，在解析 thesection 参数前过滤 `..` 和 `/` 等路径穿越字符，改用 `File::Basename` 模块规范化路径。同时可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置重写规则，拦截包含 `../` 或 `%2e%2e` 的 thesection 请求参数作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0263.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1963","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5553","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20408","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1171","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1171.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e38df7a80f8aa0122f9b0f7f660a5a952c979cc6/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f89j-92rw-6x6x/GHSA-f89j-92rw-6x6x.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/cgiforum.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1171.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dirtra.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0827.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0826","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0826.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1154","title":"Joe Kloss RobinHood 1.1 RHConsole 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RobinHood 1.1 Web 服务器在处理超长 HTTP 请求时，其 RHConsole 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可向目标服务器发送特制的超长 HTTP 请求，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 BeOS R5 Pro 及更早版本上运行的 RobinHood 1.1 Web 服务器。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1154"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:16.393","remediation":"BeOS 已停止维护，RobinHood 1.1 不再有官方补丁。建议立即停用该 Web 服务器，迁移至支持的操作系统与 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）。如无法立即替换，可在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 80 端口的访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0203.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20404","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea704212a9ed8366f550e49ed4e382e3803a0ba0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1154","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1154.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8071b769fede4de3c82d6e52f9a03fe18758c5f0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pm4p-pvm5-c7wq/GHSA-pm4p-pvm5-c7wq.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1154.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88462/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0826.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0824","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0824.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1147","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 ISAPI 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 的 ISAPI .ASP 解析机制存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送包含超长 \"LANGUAGE\" 参数的恶意脚本标签触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，但需要目标服务器启用了 ASP 解析功能。由于该漏洞年代较早，微软已发布安全更新修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1147"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:15.453","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 为 IIS 4.0 发布的 ISAPI ASP LANGUAGE 缓冲区溢出安全修补程序（可从 Microsoft 支持获取 QFE 热修复），或升级至 IIS 5.0 及以上版本以彻底消除风险。临时缓解措施可部署 URLScan ISAPI 筛选器，在请求到达 ASP 引擎前拦截包含超长 LANGUAGE 参数（超过 256 字符）的恶意请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/143070","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1911","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5510","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20383","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea704212a9ed8366f550e49ed4e382e3803a0ba0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1147","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1147.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8473d6777e627a0bbc745aac735e80a8c8aa5c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p6j4-78m6-mrmc/GHSA-p6j4-78m6-mrmc.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/1xxx/cve-2000-1147.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1147.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1911/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0824.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0824.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0823","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0823.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1144","title":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6.1 根目录Inode信息泄露漏洞","description":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6.1 构建的 chroot 隔离环境中，根目录 \"/\" 的 inode 编号异常高于正常值，导致被限制在此环境中的攻击者可通过对比 inode 编号判断自身处于 chroot 环境而非真实系统。该漏洞属于信息泄露类型，虽然攻击者无法直接突破 chroot 限制，但知道被隔离的事实后可能改变攻击策略。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。影响 ManTrap 1.6.1 版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1144"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:14.993","remediation":"升级至 Recourse ManTrap 2.0 版本，该版本已修复根目录 inode 号异常问题。若无法升级，管理员可在 chroot 环境创建后手动调整根目录 inode 号至正常范围，或通过修改内核参数隐藏 inode 信息。同时建议在 chroot 环境内外部署独立的进程监控机制，防止通过 crash 工具跨 cage 获取进程信息。长期建议使用纯操作系统原装环境部署蜜罐，而非依赖软件层模拟。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0041.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0100.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97349791405580&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1909","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5472","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20381","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1144","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1144.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/37358611606378c1ef62b2ed4e6b7dfbe11dca04/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-frjf-p4xm-rf24/GHSA-frjf-p4xm-rf24.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1144.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b682c6ef-4c55-40d5-a256-35a9d22f0496.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/bfaf704c84438cafe15e6437a0f1a5a66dbac893/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--b682c6ef-4c55-40d5-a256-35a9d22f0496.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0823.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0822","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0822.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1140","title":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 蜜罐系统隐藏进程信息泄露漏洞","description":"Recourse ManTrap 1.6 蜜罐系统中存在隐藏进程泄露漏洞。攻击者可通过对比 kill 命令结果与 /proc 文件系统中的进程列表，发现被隐藏的进程，从而判断自身处于蜜罐环境而非真实系统。该漏洞导致蜜罐的隐蔽性失效，使其欺骗和溯源功能无法正常发挥，影响 ManTrap 1.6 及 1.6.1 版本。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1140"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:14.330","remediation":"建议升级到 ManTrap 1.6.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 /proc 文件系统中进程信息未正确隐藏的问题。如无法升级，可通过内核安全模块（如 SELinux/AppArmor）限制非特权用户对 /proc/\\<PID\\> 目录的访问权限，或在系统层面使用 hidepid 选项重新挂载 /proc 文件系统，防止攻击者通过对比 kill 命令结果与 /proc 列表来识别蜜罐环境。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0041.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0100.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1908","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5473","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20380","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1140.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1140","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1140.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1140.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/37358611606378c1ef62b2ed4e6b7dfbe11dca04/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jh79-c7cc-fx5h/GHSA-jh79-c7cc-fx5h.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1140.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0cdce11a-05c3-432d-a247-9e4572e38004.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/bfaf704c84438cafe15e6437a0f1a5a66dbac893/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--0cdce11a-05c3-432d-a247-9e4572e38004.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0822.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0822.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0822.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0821","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0821.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1134","title":"多款 Unix Shell 程序 Here-Document 符号链接竞争条件漏洞","description":"多种 Unix 系统下的 shell 程序（包括 tcsh、csh、sh 和 bash）在处理 here-document 重定向（<< 操作符）时存在符号链接（symlink）竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在目标用户执行脚本或命令时创建恶意的符号链接，诱使 shell 程序将输出重定向到攻击者指定的任意文件，从而覆盖其他用户的敏感文件。该漏洞利用条件要求攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，且能够预测或观察到目标用户使用 here-document 的时机。成功利用可导致任意文件覆写，进而可能实现权限提升或系统破坏。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1134"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:13.380","remediation":"升级各 shell 程序至修复版本：tcsh 升级至 6.10 或更高版本，bash 升级至 2.04 或更高版本，csh/tcsh 升级至包含 FreeBSD-SA-00:76 补丁的版本。各 Linux 发行版用户应安装对应安全更新：Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2000:117/RHSA-2000:121，Debian 安装 20001111a 更新，Mandrake 安装 MDKSA-2000:069/MDKSA-2000:075。如无法立即升级，可通过 umask 限制和文件系统审计缓解本地 symlink 攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0418.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/tru64/2002-q1/0009.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000350","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000354","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97561816504170&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-042.0.txt","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-043.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001111a","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/10277","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-069.php3","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-075.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-117.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-121.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/146657","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1926","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2006","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A4047","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20436","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-1134.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1134.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1134","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1134.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-j272-pr5g-4cv9/GHSA-j272-pr5g-4cv9.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5efb5641cd6797d997be61005a4379e90a26bc5/2000/CVE-2000-1134.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-075.nasl","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5c157336-f00e-4259-9242-4cda5babb5de.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0821.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0820","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0820.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1132","title":"DCForum cgforum.cgi 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"DCForum 的 cgforum.cgi CGI 脚本存在任意文件读取漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含畸形 'forum' 变量的 HTTP 请求，绕过访问控制读取服务器上任意文件内容，甚至可删除程序自身。该漏洞影响 DCForum 1-6 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，对系统机密性和完整性构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1132"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:13.103","remediation":"立即升级 DCForum 至官方发布的修复版本（如已不可获取则手动修补 cgforum.cgi），在脚本入口处对 forum 参数做严格过滤，拒绝含 `../`、`..\\\\`、空字节及非字母数字的异常输入；同时在 Web 服务器层禁用对该 CGI 脚本的访问或限制其可读取目录范围。由于 DCForum 已停止维护，建议迁移至活跃更新的论坛系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0218.html","http://www.dcscripts.com/dcforum/dcfNews/124.html#1","http://www.osvdb.org/1646","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1951","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5533","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20405","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e