止维护，McAfee 未发布补丁。建议立即迁移至受支持的现代邮件安全网关（如 McAfee Email Gateway 最新版本）；若无法迁移，可在上游 SMTP 代理层配置收件人字段格式校验规则，限制收件人字段只允许邮箱标准字符（字母、数字、@、.、-、_），并拒绝空值或包含控制字符的异常收件人，同时启用 SMTP 会话速率限制以缓解拒绝服务攻击影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0324.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1999","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20432","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1129.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1129","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1129.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1129.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5b2f8b03625b79b6d36ea6d04f395c035c3e0b82/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c8f7-vr5w-4grr/GHSA-c8f7-vr5w-4grr.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1999/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1129.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0819.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0818","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0818.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1127","title":"HP HP-UX registrar 本地任意文件读取漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.20 的 HP 资源监视器服务中的 registrar 组件存在本地任意文件读写漏洞。本地攻击者可将原始的 registrar.log 日志文件重命名，并创建指向任意目标文件的符号链接，随后 registrar 会将日志信息追加写入该目标文件并将其权限设置为全局可读，从而实现对系统任意文件的读取与修改。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 10.20 操作系统，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1127"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:12.403","remediation":"立即停止并禁用 registrar 服务（/sbin/init.d/registrar stop；chkconfig registrar off），或升级到 HP-UX 11.0 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，移除 registrar 的可执行权限并限制本地登录用户仅为受信任的管理员账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/143845","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1919","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20386","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b27fe583dd73cd29e/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1127","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1127.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo/blob/f2163b4f7618847ae6f61df336623d37548fdbfc/unittests/scans/sonarqube/sonar.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/34be50da481c4de09d71edba37b06626b315858e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r6hg-vfqv-94j7/GHSA-r6hg-vfqv-94j7.json","https://github.com/codacy/codacy-sonar-csharp/blob/8d00179580be80debdef53b5bd7e039e36da0ab0/docs/description/S4792.md","https://github.com/dmm-com/mcp-pagoda/blob/e328a203bb664fcf0f697a42db2d2446af08e784/src/mcp_server/lib/log.py","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0818.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0818.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0818.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0815","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0815.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1124","title":"IBM AIX 4.3.x piobe 命令本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.x 系统中的 piobe 命令存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于该命令未对用户提供的环境变量长度进行充分检查，本地攻击者可通过向 piobe 传递超长的环境变量参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据，成功利用此漏洞可获得目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 4.3.x 系列版本，需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1124"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11.990","remediation":"立即安装 IBM AIX APAR IY12638 补丁，升级 piobe 命令至修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可移除 piobe 命令的 setuid 位（chmod -s /usr/lib/lpd/piobe），并限制仅授权管理员可执行该命令，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY12638&apar=only","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2037","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5616","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20455","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b27fe583dd73cd29e/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1124","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1124.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/35654e096c2a49809e9bb5907f49e27c931fdaa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5pm6-j89m-8mmq/GHSA-5pm6-j89m-8mmq.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c3696b11-98bf-458c-9db9-17f24ed06845.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/bfaf704c84438cafe15e6437a0f1a5a66dbac893/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0815.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0814","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0814.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1121","title":"IBM AIX enq 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.x 及更早版本中的 enq 命令存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 enq 命令处理过长的 -M 参数时，由于未对输入长度进行充分校验，导致栈缓冲区溢出，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞以 root 权限执行任意命令。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，通过精心构造的 -M 参数触发溢出，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1121"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11.570","remediation":"立即安装 IBM AIX APAR IY08143 或 IY08287 补丁包，可通过 IBM Fix Central 搜索对应 APAR 编号下载安装。对于仍在使用 AIX 4.3.x 的系统，建议升级至 IBM AIX 7.2 或 7.3 等受支持版本。临时缓解措施可移除 enq 命令的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/enq），限制本地普通用户对该命令的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08143&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08287&apar=only","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2034","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5619","https:/