ediation":"立即安装 IBM AIX APAR IY08143 或 IY08287 补丁，可通过 IBM Fix Central 获取并应用对应更新。如无法打补丁，可执行 `chmod 0 /usr/lib/lpd/digest` 移除 digest 命令的 setuid 权限位，或通过 `chmod u-s /usr/lib/lpd/digest` 去除 setuid 位以缓解本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08143&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08287&apar=only","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2033","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5620","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20453","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1120","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1120.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d32fbb1d4025b1bea886959235df20ad5eb6c39d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cx9f-78r3-35wj/GHSA-cx9f-78r3-35wj.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a3f178fb-be4e-4f04-9126-7a428781adbd.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/158dea8303c58859521e12d6c7ff455ac536c21d/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0813.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0812","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0812.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1119","title":"IBM AIX setsenv 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.x 及更早版本系统中的 /usr/bin/setsenv 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当程序处理超长的 x= 参数时，未对输入长度进行有效校验，导致栈缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞以 setsenv 进程权限执行任意命令，实现权限提升。该漏洞需要本地登录权限，无法远程利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。IBM 已在后续版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1119"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11.277","remediation":"立即安装 IBM AIX 的 APAR 修复程序 IY08812 或 IY10721 以修补 setsenv 命令的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，可移除 /usr/bin/setsenv 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/setsenv），或通过文件权限限制仅允许受信任用户执行该命令作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08812&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY10721&apar=only","http://www.osvdb.org/1676","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2032","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5621","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20452","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1119","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1119.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bbc8c0a71659f005292a66be54d5a75a1b892d59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jxr7-cc77-4ch7/GHSA-jxr7-cc77-4ch7.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c46074a4-9370-4043-ba35-be827a2b05a8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/158dea8303c58859521e12d6c7ff455ac536c21d/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0812.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0811","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0811.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1116","title":"TransSoft Broker FTP Server 用户名缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"TransSoft Broker FTP Server 4.3.0.1 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可通过向 FTP 服务器发送超长的用户名命令触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃（拒绝服务），在特定条件下可能实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 TransSoft Broker FTP Server 3.0.x 及 4.0 系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。建议升级至 4.3.0.1 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1116"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10.893","remediation":"建议升级 TransSoft Broker FTP Server 至 4.3.0.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了用户名缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可通过防火墙限制 FTP 端口（默认 21）仅允许可信 IP 访问，并禁用匿名登录以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0041.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5388","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19611","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1116.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1116","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1116.md","